{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 166901, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 111497, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "活动皮鉴赏", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1662820378, "updated_at": 1682149489, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1674544150, "last_at": 1683893774, "comment_count": 7, "status": 1, "summary": "前言1、过去的皮肤我尽量追溯考察更新。2、有大量的皮肤我也没有，还没入游或者没在意不喜欢的皮肤，有点后悔了收藏这也挺好（红莲WB皮）3、本帖为美术鉴赏分贴目录该贴按第一次出售时间排序大家可以使用Ctr", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_859/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/7/17/78543.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_894/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/8/14/10045.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_484/h_849/1069/87565/2022/8/30/842309.gif", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 9, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16980, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 8, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 166901, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、过去的皮肤我尽量追溯考察更新。</span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、有大量的皮肤我也没有，还没入游或者没在意不喜欢的皮肤<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">有点后悔了收藏这也挺好</span>（红莲WB皮）</span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">3、本帖为美术鉴赏分贴</span></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">目录</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">该贴按第一次出售时间排序大家可以使用 Ctrl+F 搜索直达</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">下方为超链接快捷到达其他分贴</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/165700.html\">美术资源鉴赏目录</a>》&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">2、《</span><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/166804.html\" style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);font-size:16px;\">氪金皮鉴赏</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">》&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>3、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/166918.html\">RD皮鉴赏</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">》&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/581250.html\">RD皮肤2</a>》</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line2\"></div><br><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:center;\">提斯帕-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">蛾子-偃月 22年9月1日 WB任务</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">官方原画</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"859\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_859/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/7/17/78543.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_859/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/7/17/78543.png\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_859/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/7/17/78543.png\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"6\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">美术设计可能参考了《斩服少女》（一部美术设计优秀的动漫，且在涩涩上不输DC）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">相似处有两点：<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、纯黑水手服红色装饰色，鲜艳的局部头发染色。<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、风格上，缠流子是本身元气放荡不羁，蛾子像是家庭缺爱少女的叛逆，个人觉得轻度赛博朋克主要是服装配色，还有蝴蝶、手机，虽然蝴蝶是魔法不是科技。</div></div></span><div><div></div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"202\" data-height=\"439\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_202/h_439/1069/87565/2022/8/10/563813.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_202/h_439/1069/87565/2022/8/10/563813.jpg\"></div></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">动图 344×405 24FPS 11MB （动作优秀）</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、点击动作不打但设计思路非常优秀（我觉得官方用心了），分为三步，亲手机、拿开手机打字（这小眼神）、转过来看镜头（恢复常态）。动作与神态十分流畅且优秀，游戏中为60FPS一般动画可没这个帧率，待机状态点击手机的动作也十分有动感（手机抖动）。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、整体干感觉如上方所说，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">像是家庭缺爱少女的叛逆打扮，以及包括小腿和膝盖上的创可贴，有些令人激起保护欲，或更想温柔的欺负她了（狗头）。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、这个蛾子看起来抑郁了，这么下去不行的，不如我们。。。。。<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">直接扑上去</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、我总觉着有点赛博朋克的感觉，正好《赛博朋克：边缘行者》没多久就出了。和《斩服少女<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">》都是扳机社的优秀作品。</span></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"344\" data-height=\"405\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_344/h_405/1069/87565/2022/8/10/916648.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_344/h_405/1069/87565/2022/8/10/916648.gif\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:center;\">伊芙-</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">路痴</span>-中秋佳人 22年9月15日&nbsp; 邮箱直接送</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">官方图</span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1，伊芙的中秋回家路第一天我就在想这个界面图标的伊芙形象这么好看，官方应该不能浪费这个立绘素材，估计得出皮肤。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2，没想到这么快就放出全身立绘了，还是活动皮。快开门啊是我<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">伊芙啊，好家伙你是迷路了吧（伊芙人设路痴），你这是直接迷路到我被窝里了（皮肤直接白给了）。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、传统韩风服装具体什么年代的我还是学习一下吧，和萨拉苏是同样款式，背景是经典代表伊芙的蓝玫瑰，魔法蝴蝶估计是楼上蛾子友情**的（滑稽）。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、虽然不知道韩服无和谐立绘怎样，我觉得就这样特挺好，大家专注欣赏这个造型，和伊芙的腿（呲溜）。</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></span></span><div></div><img data-width=\"894\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_894/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/8/14/10045.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_894/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/8/14/10045.png\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_894/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/8/14/10045.png\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"6\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">动图 484×849 24FPS 23MB</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"484\" data-height=\"849\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_484/h_849/1069/87565/2022/8/30/842309.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_484/h_849/1069/87565/2022/8/30/842309.gif\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">暗伊芙不论是原皮还是温泉皮，这气质真是拿捏，我爱死。</div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">皮肤独立语音</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div>沙雕摘取：</div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;DS：明亮的月亮，预示命运<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第一个故事：听说我在人气投票里得了第一名，那是肯定的。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;（喂喂这是哪里的活动我怎么不知道）</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;被击：差一点衣服就毁了（笑死）</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;开场：我来负责引路</span><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;退场：原来不是这边的路啊</div></span></span></span><div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"607\" data-height=\"763\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_607/h_763/1069/87565/2022/9/1/525324.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_607/h_763/1069/87565/2022/9/1/525324.png\"></div><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:center;\">索尔-</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">寸拳人-玉炎军神 22年10月13日 WB任务-绝版联动</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1014/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/9/12/275303.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"1014\" data-height=\"1024\"><br></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">动图 484×849 24FPS 23MB</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><div>1.联动活动，WB商店硬币兑换，联动都是限定以后没机会了。</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"549\" data-height=\"914\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_549/h_914/1069/87565/2022/9/21/400074.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_549/h_914/1069/87565/2022/9/21/400074.gif\"></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:center;\">迪瓦茨-</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">嫂子-家爱 22年12月22日 WB任务</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><img data-width=\"1014\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1014/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/11/7/90785.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1014/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/11/7/90785.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1014/h_1024/1069/72324/2022/11/7/90785.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"8\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">动图 892×986 24FPS 121MB 流量警告</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、真是让人血脉喷张的婚纱，小腿挡住的关键部位应该是也是粉白颜色，说不定有点像连体泳衣的设计。</span>主要图形样式是各种花朵组成的蕾丝造型，看着有莲花、菊花、樱花、可能还会有玫瑰。无所谓了他们经常喜欢画一些架空的花朵造型。腰间的大花可能是牡丹。头饰和花捧应该都是玫瑰。<div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、这机制的身材，晶莹剔透的肤色，丰满不做作双峰，美好的腰臀比，健康的臀腿，修长的小腿和娇小的脚丫。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、白丝长筒袜衬托丰满的腿部曲线，袜口处花朵团边沿起分割作用，有袜子和没有袜子的部分是分开欣赏的。高跟鞋的款式造型和跟高坡度显得足部娇俏玲珑。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、待机动作好过一般皮肤，嫂子的食指会靠近下唇，做思考和欣赏的姿态。而且右手放回胸部时会显出一个较为真实的手部阴影。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、结婚都多少年了大家不要想着NTR了，什么你说结过婚的更好？</div></span><div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"986\" data-height=\"892\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_986/h_892/1069/87565/2022/11/23/137769.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_986/h_892/1069/87565/2022/11/23/137769.gif\"></div></div><div>我早期剑灵人物和这个比较相似，同样的身材、发色、瞳色。</div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);